    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMON DUST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the hum of machines and the speech-like groans of surreal fauna, gunshots ring out. You Are Alone. The most alone anyone has ever been, or ever will be. And even still you seek to descend deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through nine labyrinthine floors of monsters, traps, and ?????</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect DUST to purchase items and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contend with a variety of surreal and terrifying foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the bottom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the Truth.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMON DUST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the hum of machines and the speech-like groans of surreal fauna, gunshots ring out. You Are Alone. The most alone anyone has ever been, or ever will be. And even still you seek to descend deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through nine labyrinthine floors of monsters, traps, and ?????</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect DUST to purchase items and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contend with a variety of surreal and terrifying foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the bottom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the Truth.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "DEMON DUST is a Survival Horror Dungeon Crawler with a unique, mouse driven interface. Scavenge the depths of concrete and metal while rationing supplies to stay alive.",
